# How To: Create Evaluation

This tipsheet will show you how to add an Evaluation to the LMS. Evaluations can be attached to any training object in Cornerstone, and can be set to optional or required.

## Create a Category and Questions

1. Navigate to Menu > Content Management > Catalog > Evaluations.
2. Click on the *Question Bank* link.  
![eval1](https://mnfhs.sharepoint.com/sites/LearningManagementSystem/Shared%20Documents/OngoingCompetency/create-eval-1.png)
3. Click on the *Categories* tab and click the *Create New Category* button.  
4. Enter the title and click the *Save* button.  
![eval2](https://mnfhs.sharepoint.com/sites/LearningManagementSystem/Shared%20Documents/OngoingCompetency/create-eval-2.png)
5. Click on the **Questions** tab and click the *Create New Question* button.  
![eval3](https://mnfhs.sharepoint.com/sites/LearningManagementSystem/Shared%20Documents/OngoingCompetency/create-eval-3.png)
6. Enter your test question
7. Select the type of question (Response Type). Response Types include the following: Yes/No, True/False, Multiple Choice/Single Answer, Multiple Choice/Multiple Answer, Text Only, Free Form (Essay), Click On Image
8. Add your response choices (applicable only to Multiple Choice Response Types) and check the *Always Display* option for each *unless* you would like users to see different sets of possible answers. 
9. Select multi-part or comments if desired.
10. Select the Category created in Step 3.
11. Click the *Submit* button.
![eval4](https://mnfhs.sharepoint.com/sites/LearningManagementSystem/Shared%20Documents/OngoingCompetency/create-eval-4.png)
12. Repeat for all questions.  

---

## Create the Test

1. Navigate to Menu > Content Management > Catalog > Evaluations.
2. Click the *Create New Evaluation* button.
3. Enter the Evaluation Name (it should match the category you created in the previous section).
4. CLick the *+* button next in the Sections and Questions column header.
5. Enter the Section Title/Instructions and click the "Done" button.
![eval5](https://mnfhs.sharepoint.com/sites/LearningManagementSystem/Shared%20Documents/OngoingCompetency/create-eval-5.png)
6. Click the *+?* button in the Options column.
![eval6](https://mnfhs.sharepoint.com/sites/LearningManagementSystem/Shared%20Documents/OngoingCompetency/create-eval-6.png)
7. Select the Category you previously created in the *Category* dropdown.
8. Click the *Search* button.
9. Click the *Add All Questions* button.
![eval7](https://mnfhs.sharepoint.com/sites/LearningManagementSystem/Shared%20Documents/OngoingCompetency/create-eval-7.png)
10. Click the *Done* button.
11. Check the *Response Required* checkbox for any questions as desired.
12. Scroll down and click the *Submit* button.

